# ⚠ THE BRAND BUNDLE IS NOT COMMITTED — founder's standing instruction.
# It is 1.6MB of design-tool HTML with an inlined React runtime, and it was
# swept in once by `git add design/brand` (a DIRECTORY add has the same effect
# as `git add -A` for untracked files, which is the mistake this line prevents
# recurring). CodeQL scanned it and raised five alerts — an xss-through-dom and
# four cross-window-information-leak — none of them our code.
# `design/brand/BRAND.md` is the committed extract; read the bundle for anything
# it does not cover.
design/brand/InstaHealth Brand Assets.html
